# The Ninth Howl: rumours, villain hints and warnings between residents (cast-and-talk.md §4, §5.1; doc 86 §6.4-6.6).
# Generated from the same source as the window's gossip lines in dialogue/resident.tree (talk library part 2). Every
# rule is gated on the campaign's talk memory (world.mem.nh_*: C8 talk.remember, or the DM by hand until C8 lands) and
# the speaker's own dialect, so the test town never says them and the scorecards don't move. Rumours ride talk.news and
# talk.gossip, villain hints talk.gossip, warnings talk.news and talk.bandits. No names (roles, or a figure once C9 or
# the DM's save_figure sets it); no line dates the Moot (decisions §6.4).

rule nh_grace_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The factors gave a moon's grace. Generous of them, they say. It only means the interest runs a month longer.

rule nh_grace_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A moon's grace from the factors, eh? Like letting a fish run with the hook still in. Deep and dark, it comes in all the same.

rule nh_grace_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A moon's grace on every note, #address#. Fair price, they call it. Weigh the interest, then tell me it's fair.

rule nh_grace_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The factors gave the debtors a moon's grace. Chaff and promises, #address#. The note's still due, only later.

rule nh_grace_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A moon's grace, no? Boggy sort of grace. The water's still rising, only slower.

rule nh_grace_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The factors gave a moon's grace, #address#. A grace you pay interest on is not a grace. It is a longer leash.

rule nh_grace_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A moon's grace on the notes, mm? Bark and branch, the rot keeps working under the bark.

rule nh_grace_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_debts=grace
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The factors gave a moon's grace. Dead rock talk. The note weighs the same, only colder.

rule nh_king_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The old King's gone up to the Bright One. And they say the one keeping the Palace lamp still walks his Sump round.

rule nh_king_plain_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say There's a camp on the Oakhaven road that won't starve out. Somebody's feeding it.

rule nh_king_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The notice on the Oakhaven board was signed with a grey paw-mark. Nobody signs like that who means well.

rule nh_moot_called_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot! Blood and bread, I never thought I'd see one called.

rule nh_moot_called_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_purse=greatly
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House paid for the old King's wake. Fine wake. Long account.

rule nh_moot_called_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_purse=household
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Queen's household paid for the wake from its own purse, they say. Bright One bless a house that pays its way.

rule nh_king_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A patrolman keeping the Palace lamp, eh? Still water runs strange in the city.

rule nh_king_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Wet ash on the wind from the Alder Mere side. That's no fisher's fire, eh?

rule nh_king_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't take the Oakhaven road alone. Something's camped under the oaks, eh?

rule nh_king_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_willa=alone
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our carter walked home alone. Nobody came for her. Muddied, that.

rule nh_moot_called_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot, eh? The old folk speak of one. Said it was the only time the city asked the lake anything.

rule nh_king_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Watch guard keeping the Palace lamp? By the market cross, the Houses will have that weighed and short-weighed by Marketday.

rule nh_king_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody's buying the Oakhaven road off the carters. Fair price? Not to the carters.

rule nh_king_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Wagons to the Sound Road go in pairs now. Scales and silver, I'd not send one alone.

rule nh_king_larkfield_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The market beam weighs light, some say. Weights and measures, and the factors still want paying by the new moon.

rule nh_moot_called_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot! Every town a voice. That's the first fair market the city's ever held.

rule nh_king_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The old King's gone up, they say. Sheaf and sickle, I hope the next one likes apples.

rule nh_king_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Carters say the Oakhaven road's got a toll on it now, and no tollhouse.

rule nh_king_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't send a cart north alone, neighbour. They wait for the lone ones.

rule nh_moot_called_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot of every town? Ripe days for talkers, then.

rule nh_king_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say That lamp-keeper's got fen in his mouth, I hear. Talks like the old ones on the boardwalk, no?

rule nh_king_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Mirebridge-born, they say, the wolf with the lamp. Dark One's mire, the drowned get a king at last.

rule nh_king_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Grey paw-marks on the Oakhaven board, no? Boggy business, signing with a paw.

rule nh_king_mirebridge_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Keep off the Oakhaven road alone, #address#. Something's sitting on it.

rule nh_king_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Summons reached the well, #address#. The well remembers who drew from it. We will see whether the city does.

rule nh_king_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A guard keeping the Palace lamp. In the oasis we would say: a well is kept by whoever draws the water.

rule nh_king_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Caravans say the north road has a keeper who is not the Watch. By salt and water, I mistrust a keeper with no face.

rule nh_king_saltwell_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Caravans that walk the north road alone come in short, #address#. Walk in company, or wait for one.

rule nh_king_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Slow news, the city. A king gone up a fortnight before the Sound Road hears it, mm?

rule nh_king_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Grey paw-mark on our board. Proper strange. Wolves who sign with a paw don't sign with a name.

rule nh_king_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't walk the Oakhaven road alone. Bark and branch, we've lost a wagon already.

rule nh_king_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_logger=believed
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Still a thief, the logger, if you ask the store. I don't ask the store, mm?

rule nh_king_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Patrolman keeping the Palace lamp. Deep strange. Keep your lamp lit, they say. Well, someone is.

rule nh_king_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody's paying carters for their days. In Frosthollow we call that buying a road.

rule nh_king_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=king|moot_called self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't take the Pass Road alone, #address#. Lamps where there's no house.

rule nh_moot_called_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot_called self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot. The city remembered the valley. Lamp and pick, it'll forget again by spring.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Chalk on the doors in the Sump. The Counting House wants every debtor's howl for the Moot.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_debts=eased
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A wolf of the road worked off a neighbour's note and asked nothing back. That's the Sump I remember.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House master gives every debtor a moon's grace. Grace, he calls it.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.figure_villain
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #world.figure_villain# gives every debtor a moon's grace. Grace, he calls it.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't sign anything the clerks bring round. Chalk washes off. Ink doesn't.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_debts=called
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They called in every note at the new moon. Half the Sump's howl belongs to the Counting House now.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_ledger=shown
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A ledger went to the Antechamber, and the Sump's doubled debts are struck. Bright One keep whoever carried it.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_8
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_ledger=ash
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Somebody burned a Counting House ledger, they say. Ash doesn't testify, but it doesn't lie either.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_9
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_loan=taken
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Crown took the Counting House's loan. Every small note paid, and the Crown in the book instead.

rule nh_reckoning_plain_10
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_loan=refused
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Queen's household turned down the Counting House's loan. The notes stand, but the Crown's its own.

rule nh_reckoning_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Factors chalking doors in the city, eh? Out here we'd call that marking a net that isn't yours.

rule nh_reckoning_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Counting House pennies at the carters' yard. Deep and dark, those coins swim upstream.

rule nh_reckoning_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't lend your wagon days to a guard with his badge cut off, eh?

rule nh_reckoning_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Short-weighed, the lot of it. Fair price to you, they say, and the scale's got a thumb on it.

rule nh_reckoning_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House lends with one paw and weighs with the other. Weights and measures, I know a cheat's scale.

rule nh_reckoning_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If a clerk asks you to sign for a neighbour, read it twice and sign nothing.

rule nh_reckoning_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Notes due at the new moon? Chaff and promises, #address#.

rule nh_reckoning_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House master wants every howl in the realm. Blight take him, he can't carry a tune.

rule nh_reckoning_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't let them chalk your door, neighbour. Scrub it before the moon's up.

rule nh_reckoning_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Owe a House a penny and they own your boots. Lucky we go barefoot in the fens, no?

rule nh_reckoning_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A clerk in the city smells of smoke. Fen-sure, some fires aren't for warming.

rule nh_reckoning_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't take the House's coin for your howl, #address#. Mirebridge sold its say once, and look where it got us.

rule nh_reckoning_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A loan the borrower cannot refuse is not a loan, #address#. It is a leash.

rule nh_reckoning_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The master of the Counting House has never once been thirsty. That is how you know a dangerous wolf.

rule nh_reckoning_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Do not pledge your voice for coin, #address#. The well remembers who drew from it.

rule nh_reckoning_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They chalk doors in the city, mm? We'd mark a tree that way before we felled it.

rule nh_reckoning_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Bark and branch, a lender who wants your howl wants your whole tree.

rule nh_reckoning_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't sell your wagon days, old root. You'll want the road back.

rule nh_reckoning_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Captain's quiet. Too quiet. Dead rock talk, that note on the mine.

rule nh_reckoning_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House rider comes up the Pass Road. Lamp and pick, somebody wants his letters lost.

rule nh_reckoning_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the mine captain offers you a share in anything, count your claws after.

rule nh_reckoning_frosthollow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=reckoning self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_seam=crooked
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The quota's met, they say, with ore that isn't ours. Black seam. Somebody'll pay for that.

rule nh_signals_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Somebody's gathering the lists of who pays the Watch. Mind whose name you say aloud in a taproom.

rule nh_signals_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_lists=press
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say It's printed. The whole list, on every board. Half the Watch can't meet your eye.

rule nh_signals_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_lists=sold
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lists went to the Counting House, they say. The sergeant's on the Harbour Gate now. Funny, that.

rule nh_signals_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_lists=captain
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Watch Captain burned the lists in front of the sergeants, they say. Nobody on them pays twice now.

rule nh_signals_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_lists=lost
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Watch lists went into the river, they say. Half the Watch slept easy that night.

rule nh_signals_plain_6
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Three Houses on every list, they say. One on none. Ask yourself why it needn't pay.

rule nh_signals_plain_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Cinder Gate looks away for a grey paw-mark. Don't trust that gate after dark.

rule nh_signals_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Lamps on the downs, two long and one short. That's no fisher's light, eh?

rule nh_signals_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A captain in grey taking a mark a wagon, eh? Deep and dark, that's a toll with no tollhouse.

rule nh_signals_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=coldwater world.figure_villain world.mem.nh_captain=named
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #world.figure_villain#, they're calling him. Keeps the roads, he says. Keeps them shut.

rule nh_signals_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The camp above Glasswater comes back in threes. Don't go in alone, eh?

rule nh_signals_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Watch you can buy is a scale you can lean on. Scales and silver, I'd like to see that list.

rule nh_signals_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Two long and one short. Somebody's selling our wagon days, and the price is a lamp on a hill.

rule nh_signals_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't buy a list from the fish hall. It's short-weighed paper.

rule nh_signals_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The fish-hall wolf sells papers, and they smell of fish oil. Blight take it, don't pay her a penny.

rule nh_signals_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody in grey keeps the roads now, they say. Wormy sort of keeping.

rule nh_signals_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If you see two long and one short, don't wait to count again.

rule nh_signals_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say In the fens the Watch never came at all, so nobody paid. Boggy sort of honesty, no?

rule nh_signals_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Grey paw-marks on every board now. Fen-sure, he's proud of it.

rule nh_signals_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A lamp you can't see the house behind is a lamp you don't follow.

rule nh_signals_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Watch that is paid by a House guards that House's well, not yours, #address#.

rule nh_signals_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A road kept by no one is kept for someone, #address#. Ask who the grey keeper keeps it for.

rule nh_signals_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_captain=named
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Caravans called him the keeper with no face. Now he has a name, they say, and a grey cloak.

rule nh_signals_saltwell_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Do not buy secrets that smell of fish, #address#. Sweet water does not smell of anything.

rule nh_signals_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Rot starts under the bark, mm? You don't see it till the tree's down.

rule nh_signals_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A captain of the roads with no road of his own. Windthrown sort of wolf, mm?

rule nh_signals_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't walk under a lit knoll, old root. They're watching from up there.

rule nh_signals_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A harness turned up on the Pass Road, old and sooty. Deep strange.

rule nh_signals_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody's lighting lamps on our ridges and it isn't us. Lamp and pick, I'd like a word with him.

rule nh_signals_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=frosthollow world.figure_villain world.mem.nh_captain=named
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #world.figure_villain#, they're saying. Knows the dark like a good seam.

rule nh_signals_frosthollow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=signals self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If you hear two long and one short from a ridge, #address#, you're already seen.

rule nh_howls_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Eight towns howling at dusk and one silent. The old folk say the ninth was the loudest.

rule nh_howls_plain_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House is buying howls, they say. A penny a throat. Ask yourself what a bought Moot sounds like.

rule nh_howls_plain_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_relay=ran|broke
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The ridge howled back two long and one short on the relay night. That wasn't ours.

rule nh_howls_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House says a bought howl still counts. Buy yours back if you sold it.

rule nh_howls_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_cough=tended
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The King's daughter climbed the Hundred Steps without stopping. Somebody sat with her.

rule nh_howls_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A gathering howl? We've one for the drowned, one for a catch and one for supper, and I'd not swear which, eh?

rule nh_howls_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody wants the old howls lost, eh? Deep and dark, a Moot with no howl can't sit.

rule nh_howls_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_relay=ran|broke
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say False howls off the ridge, two long and one short. Deep and dark, he even steals our singing.

rule nh_howls_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't howl the burying one at a wedding. It's been done. It was awful, eh?

rule nh_howls_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Larkfield's howl goes up at the end like a price. Scales and silver, it's the best one.

rule nh_howls_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A howl from the ridge, they say, and it wasn't from any town. Somebody's put a price on our song.

rule nh_howls_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If you've sold your howl to the Counting House, buy it back. It's worth more than a note.

rule nh_howls_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our gathering howl? Blight take it, I've only ever known the harvest one.

rule nh_howls_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_howl=found
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A good harvest of a night! Half the vale came out to howl.

rule nh_howls_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody chiselled a name off the Sunfields stone. Wormy business, that.

rule nh_howls_southmeadow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't sing at the stone of a night unless the sky's clear. The cellar hand says so, and she's odd but right.

rule nh_howls_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Ninth howl's gone under, #address#. Mirebridge got drowned, and the drowned don't howl. Or do they, no?

rule nh_howls_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Houses struck Mirebridge off the rolls. Struck it off so the Moot could never sit, they say.

rule nh_howls_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't sing the drowned howl on the boardwalk of a night. The old ones don't like it.

rule nh_howls_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The old one at the salt pans keeps the well's roll, #address#. Every caravan that ever drank is in it.

rule nh_howls_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A howl that answers from a ridge with no town under it is a mirage, #address#. Do not follow it.

rule nh_howls_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Do not hurry an old wolf's song. Saltwell begins nothing in a hurry.

rule nh_howls_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our howl's slow and it climbs, like good bark. Come by the square at dusk, mm?

rule nh_howls_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody's teaching false howls from the ridges, mm? Rotten at the root, that.

rule nh_howls_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_relay=ran|broke
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say False howls on the relay night, they say. Somebody's got lamps and a throat.

rule nh_howls_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The relay night wants a wolf at every post. One gap and it limps, mm?

rule nh_howls_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say In Frosthollow the warning howl goes low, so it carries down the shafts. The gathering one's lower still.

rule nh_howls_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Deepvein wolves knew a howl too, once. Nobody's heard it since the deep winter.

rule nh_howls_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't go onto Highmere alone, #address#. The ice keeps what it takes.

rule nh_howls_frosthollow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=howls self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_silver=greatly
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The silver went to the Counting House. Black seam. The mine's charter is a Greatly note now.

rule nh_letters_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Someone's carrying every letter for the Grayrock lord out to his road at last. Forty of them.

rule nh_letters_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_grayrock=home
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Grayrock lady walked out to the Wharf gate. Didn't even put her hood up.

rule nh_letters_plain_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Some of those letters are toll receipts, they say, signed with a grey paw. Grayrock pays the roads to stay shut.

rule nh_letters_plain_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_toll=cried
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The herald cried a Grayrock toll receipt on the square. The Sump cheered. The Wharf didn't.

rule nh_letters_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Fell wants the Rainward Hills, and Fell's green is on the wolves driving stakes. Mind the cut.

rule nh_letters_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bounders in green on the Oakhaven road, eh? Fishers don't drive stakes into the ground.

rule nh_letters_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Green cloaks and grey lamps, together. Deep and dark, who's paying whom?

rule nh_letters_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Black cloaks on the Pass Road, eh? Wardens, they say. Fair winds to whoever they've come for.

rule nh_letters_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Fell wants the hills. Fell wants everything with a price on it, #address#.

rule nh_letters_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Grayrock pays one mark a wagon on the High Road. Scales and silver, to whom?

rule nh_letters_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't take a Fell errand without reading it. Fellhall has more rooms than doors.

rule nh_letters_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A lord who's never home is like a vine never pruned. All runners, no grapes, #address#.

rule nh_letters_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Fell's green cloaks are driving stakes in Oakhaven's cut. Blight take them.

rule nh_letters_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't trust a wager in the Fell distillery. The house always drinks first.

rule nh_letters_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Forty letters and not one answered. In the fens we'd call that a very wet postbag, no?

rule nh_letters_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Grey paw-marks on the lord's toll receipts. Boggy coin, that.

rule nh_letters_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't step between Fell and Oakhaven, #address#. Both sides have axes.

rule nh_letters_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The well remembers who drew from it. The lord has drawn for six years and never come back to the well.

rule nh_letters_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A House that pays the roads to stay shut buys a thirst for everyone else.

rule nh_letters_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Black cloaks on the Pass Road, #address#. If you carry a Gift, carry it quietly.

rule nh_letters_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Walk the bounds with us? Mark every ninth cedar and the old boundary stone, mm?

rule nh_letters_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_hills=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Good bark, those wolves. The cut's ours yet. Root well.

rule nh_letters_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_hills=fell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Fell's hills now. Windthrown, the lot of us. Oakhaven howls against Fell at the Moot.

rule nh_letters_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Wolves in Fell green on the cut, and the Captain's lamps behind them. Same paws, different cloaks, mm?

rule nh_letters_oakhaven_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't argue with a bounder alone, old root. They come in threes.

rule nh_letters_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Three black cloaks came down the Pass on Stoneday. Didn't take their boots off at the Pass House. Deep strange.

rule nh_letters_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's bounders wear Fell green in the west, they say. Grey up here. Same wolves.

rule nh_letters_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=letters self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't lie to a black cloak, cousin. Don't tell them more than's true, either.

rule nh_lights_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Houses are at each other's throats, and a black cloak sits in the Antechamber listening to all of it.

rule nh_lights_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_quarrel=fell_timber
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Timberland works burned in the night. Every smith in the Cinders swears it wasn't them.

rule nh_lights_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_quarrel=houses_greatly
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say There's a run on the Greatly Bank. The masons have walked off the Yard.

rule nh_lights_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_quarrel=greatly_grayrock
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Grayrock's closed the Wharf to Greatly stone. The Wharf's idle and the Yard's shouting.

rule nh_lights_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_quarrel=against_crown
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Council wants the lamp-keeper gone before the Moot sits. Petitions on every desk.

rule nh_lights_plain_6
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A black cloak at the Antechamber, and every House shouting. Somebody's glad of the noise.

rule nh_lights_plain_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Cudgels in House colours on the roads out of the city. Walk round them.

rule nh_lights_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Houses at each other in the city and lights in the fens. A good season to mend nets, eh?

rule nh_lights_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Lamp oil in the reeds. Deep and dark, the same lamps as on the ridges.

rule nh_lights_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't follow a warm light in the fens, neighbour. Cold ones only, they say.

rule nh_lights_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A black cloak on the Fen Road, and the price of a room on the Long River just doubled.

rule nh_lights_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Plunder up the river by night. Weights and measures, somebody's fencing the Captain's take.

rule nh_lights_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't buy cheap wool from a fen boat. You'll be buying it twice.

rule nh_lights_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Fen boats on the Long River by night, no lamps lit. Blight take them, a Larkholm carter lost a cart of honey.

rule nh_lights_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's southern company wades the fens with float lamps. Wormy trick.

rule nh_lights_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If you walk the fens by night, take a friend and a lamp you won't light.

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Lights in the reeds every night now, no? The old ones say the drowned want their names said.

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore here.weather=fog
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Dry feet. Mizzle's up. If you see a light, follow it, but only the cold ones, no?

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_lights=laid
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Dark marsh and dry feet. The priest from the city said every name.

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_lights=turned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They used the drowned for bait. Dark One's mire, we'll pay for that.

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_5
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Float lamps in the reeds, fen-sure. The drowned never needed lamps to walk.

rule nh_lights_mirebridge_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The potter's post went to a carpenter and the boardwalks whisper. Ask the records before you whisper too.

rule nh_lights_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say In the old way, #address#, you bring bread and salt to a House at war. Even a House needs to eat.

rule nh_lights_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Lights in the fens, fire in the city, cudgels on the roads. A mirage of three, and one paw behind it.

rule nh_lights_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Do not hide a Gift from the black cloak and then use it in the open, #address#.

rule nh_lights_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Houses are windthrown in a row this season, mm? One falls and takes the next.

rule nh_lights_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Cudgels in House colours at the Rainward camps. Proper strange that a House needs a camp.

rule nh_lights_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't take sides in the city's quarrel, old root. Take bread.

rule nh_lights_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Lights in the fens, fire in the city. Black seam of a season.

rule nh_lights_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's company's gone south to the fens. Cold iron, we're glad and we're not.

rule nh_lights_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=lights self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say One howl from the Pass to the Waste, the black cloak wants. Our post's first. Don't let it be our fault.

rule nh_harvest_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Every wolf who can stand is at the Larkfield ford. The city's quiet as a crypt.

rule nh_harvest_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_ford=held
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They held the Larkfield ford three nights. Blood and bread, I'd have liked to see it.

rule nh_harvest_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_ford=burned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The ford burned, and Larkfield's houses with it. The realm will be short of bread before spring.

rule nh_harvest_plain_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House is buying Longmead grain at siege price. Somebody always profits.

rule nh_harvest_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Wolves carrying sacks from Longmead to the Counting House. Don't be one.

rule nh_harvest_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's at the ford, eh? Then the downs are quiet. Fair catch, for once.

rule nh_harvest_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Lamp-black at the ford too, they say. Same lamps as on our ridges.

rule nh_harvest_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the ford burns, the whole realm's short of bread. Help it hold, neighbour.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Every sack in Longmead's gone to the ford walls. Scales and silver, I never thought I'd see grain for a rampart.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_ford=burned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Short-weighed, all of it. The year, the bread, the lot.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's companies took the Downs Road barns. Weights and measures, he's counted our grain before we have.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_captain=parley
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain parleyed at the truce lamp. A wolf with a reason, and a reason's worse than a price.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't cross the ford after dark unless you're standing it, #address#. Both banks are watching.

rule nh_harvest_larkfield_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_truce=broken
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Somebody struck under the truce lamp. Weights and measures, the whole Downs is talking.

rule nh_harvest_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Every cart in the vale's gone north with something for the ford. Sheaf and sickle, the press house is empty.

rule nh_harvest_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_runner=came
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The runner came at midnight, howling the new howl. We knew it! Sheaf and sickle, we went.

rule nh_harvest_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's companies took every barn on the Downs Road. Wormy wolves.

rule nh_harvest_southmeadow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't wait for a runner if you see smoke from the ford. Go.

rule nh_harvest_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The river company comes up through the reeds. Boggy fighting, that.

rule nh_harvest_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_sloe=turned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Fen boats bringing grain upriver now, no? Not plunder. That's new.

rule nh_harvest_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's a Deepvein wolf, they say, from the high valley. Long way to come for a ford, no?

rule nh_harvest_mirebridge_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Keep off the Long River banks by night. They're all fighting there.

rule nh_harvest_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Salt and water for the wolves at the ford, #address#. The well gives to those who stand.

rule nh_harvest_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A captain who parleys has a grievance, not a greed. By salt and water, that is harder to buy off.

rule nh_harvest_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Do not leave the pool unwatched while the south is fighting.

rule nh_harvest_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Half the cut's gone south to the ford, mm? The cedars can wait. Wheat can't.

rule nh_harvest_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_captain=parley
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Old Oak, a captain who parleys. That's a wolf with a reason, mm?

rule nh_harvest_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Deepvein, they say. Turned out in the deep winter. Rotten thing to do to a wolf, mm?

rule nh_harvest_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't go to the ford without bandages, old root.

rule nh_harvest_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's a Deepvein wolf. Lamp and pick, I could have told you. Nobody shared oil with Deepvein.

rule nh_harvest_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Deepvein. The deep winter. The mine house door. Black seam, we all knew.

rule nh_harvest_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=harvest self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't say Deepvein in the Lamp and Pick unless you mean it.

rule nh_bell_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Everyone's asking what the Chancellor wept over in the Rain Hall. Turns out half the city saw him do it.

rule nh_bell_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_writ=read
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The old King wrote it down: the Sump's own peace-keeper keeps the lamp until a Moot. So it was no accident.

rule nh_bell_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_oskar=confessed
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Chancellor stood before the Council and said it all. The Counting House's debt, the order, the lot.

rule nh_bell_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_bell=lost
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They lost the bell through the ice. The Upper Mere kept it. Some say that's where it belongs.

rule nh_bell_plain_5
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House master told the Chancellor to lose it, they whisper. Lose a King's writ!

rule nh_bell_plain_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say An old rag-mill hand is selling what she saw. Get there before she gets to the City Office.

rule nh_bell_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Hear that? Under the ice. Bright One's tide, it's ringing.

rule nh_bell_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_bell=rung
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Net and line, they raised it! Green as a pike and loud as a gale, eh?

rule nh_bell_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_mere=still
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The whole mere's still. I've never seen it so. Calm water to her.

rule nh_bell_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The black cloak watches the mere all day. Deep and dark, what's she looking for?

rule nh_bell_coldwater_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't walk the black lane on the ice, neighbour. It never freezes, and nobody says why.

rule nh_bell_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A writ lost for a debt. That's the dearest paper ever bought in Ridgemere, #address#.

rule nh_bell_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House hid the old King's writ. Weights and measures, there's a cheat's scale for you.

rule nh_bell_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't go out on the Upper Mere ice alone, #address#. Weights and measures, ice doesn't bargain.

rule nh_bell_larkfield_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_ford=burned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Send bread to Larkfield before you send iron to the bell.

rule nh_bell_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The old King wanted all of us to choose? Sheaf and sickle, I'd best think what I'll say.

rule nh_bell_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Somebody bought a King's writ with a debt. Wormy, wormy business.

rule nh_bell_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't go out on the Upper Mere ice unless the skipper says it holds.

rule nh_bell_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our bell, under all that ice. Mud and eels, I'd walk the whole Long River to hear it, no?

rule nh_bell_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_oskar=fled
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Chancellor ran down the Fen Road and stopped where Mirebridge used to stand. Even the drowned didn't want him, no?

rule nh_bell_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Houses struck us off the rolls and hid the King's writ. Same paws, fen-sure.

rule nh_bell_mirebridge_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't stamp on the ice when you listen, #address#. The bell's not the only thing under it.

rule nh_bell_mirebridge_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_bell=cracked
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They rang it cracked. Don't laugh. It's still ours.

rule nh_bell_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A King writes "let the realm choose", and the Houses hide it in the dark. The Houses hid it, #address#, not the King.

rule nh_bell_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A Chancellor weeping over a paper means someone made him hold it.

rule nh_bell_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A pup who calls water is a gift and a danger, #address#. Do not hide her carelessly.

rule nh_bell_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Old Oak. The old King planted something deep before he fell, mm? Now we see the shoot.

rule nh_bell_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House paid for a writ to be lost. Rotten at the root, mm?

rule nh_bell_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't trust a sale of secrets on the Sump Stairs. Somebody's paying both ends.

rule nh_bell_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our iron's in the bell's yoke. Cold iron for a cold bell. Lamp and pick.

rule nh_bell_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say On the Moot night the Pass is his, the notice says. The Captain writes like he means it.

rule nh_bell_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=bell self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Nobody goes down alone, and nobody comes up without counting the others.

rule nh_moot_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Every town's sending its howl to the Moot. Ours goes to whoever kept the peace best.

rule nh_moot_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_moot=midwinter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Midwinter Moot! Every post on the Line wants a keeper, and every keeper wants a coat.

rule nh_moot_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_moot=nine_howls
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Moot of the Nine Howls, they're calling it. Nine towns, one night, one howl.

rule nh_moot_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_dagfinn=stands
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lamp-keeper will stand at the Moot. A Sump wolf, standing!

rule nh_moot_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_dagfinn=steps
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lamp-keeper's stepping back, they say, and asking the Moot to choose. A Sump wolf who doesn't want a crown.

rule nh_moot_plain_6
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House master says he's already counted his voices. Make sure he's counted wrong.

rule nh_moot_plain_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=ridgemere
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Captain says the Pass is his on the Moot night. If the north arm fails, the trunk starts short.

rule nh_moot_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_bell=rung|cracked
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The big thing's going to the city for the Moot. It rang once on the road, they say. On its own.

rule nh_moot_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_moot=midwinter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Midwinter Moot, eh? The mere's froze hard, and a howl carries over ice.

rule nh_moot_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=coldwater
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House has bought howls. A bought howl's a muddied one, eh?

rule nh_moot_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the howl stops at the mere post, it's not over. The next post can take it from two back, eh?

rule nh_moot_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our voice to the Moot is bought by deeds, not silver. Scales and silver, that's a market I like.

rule nh_moot_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_moot=midwinter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Midwinter Moot. Weights and measures, the coldest market the realm's ever held.

rule nh_moot_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=larkfield
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Bought howls go to the Purse, three at most. Weights and measures, that's three too many.

rule nh_moot_larkfield_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=larkfield
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't go to the Moot empty-pawed. Bring oil for a post.

rule nh_moot_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Southmeadow's voice is ready. A windfall of a Moot, #address#.

rule nh_moot_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=southmeadow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House would crown a debt if it could. Blight take it.

rule nh_moot_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=southmeadow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the pool's silent, we can still take the howl from two back. Don't give up on it.

rule nh_moot_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Mirebridge has a voice again, no? Dry feet to every wolf who carried it.

rule nh_moot_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_lights=faded
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Council would cast our voice if we're silent. The Council struck us off. Boggy justice.

rule nh_moot_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=mirebridge|fenshore
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The crossing post's out in the open. Don't stand it alone if there are cudgels about.

rule nh_moot_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Stand by the pool when the night falls, #address#. Saltwell starts the south road's howl.

rule nh_moot_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=saltwell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say A crown bought with debts is a well with salt in it, #address#.

rule nh_moot_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=saltwell
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If Saltwell is late, the whole south arm is late. Do not be late, #address#.

rule nh_moot_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A handful of wolves and one voice. That's a lot of shade for a small grove, mm?

rule nh_moot_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=oakhaven
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House would buy every voice in the grove, mm? Rotten at the root.

rule nh_moot_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_hills=fell
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Oakhaven howls against whoever Fell backs. The hills went to Fell, and we've long roots.

rule nh_moot_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=oakhaven
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the road post goes quiet, the square can't carry. Fill both, old root.

rule nh_moot_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Frosthollow starts the howl at the Pass. Lamp and pick, we'll be heard.

rule nh_moot_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.gossip world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=frosthollow
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The Captain's band gathers at the Pass the night before. Cold iron, there'll be a fight.

rule nh_moot_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.bandits world.mem.nh_stage=moot self.from=frosthollow
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If the Pass falls silent, the north arm's two posts short. Don't let it, #address#.

rule nh_after_plain_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bright One keep the Queen. And the lamp-keeper beside her, bless his flat feet.

rule nh_after_plain_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Sump wolf at the lamp, by the realm's own howl. Blood and bread, I howled for him.

rule nh_after_plain_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No crown at all, and a Moot every year. I'll believe it when it sits twice.

rule nh_after_plain_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_crown=regency world.mem.nh_moot=midwinter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No crown at all, and a Moot every Midwinter. I'll believe it when it sits twice.

rule nh_after_plain_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Counting House has the realm now. They call it a Protectorate. I call it a debt with a crown on.

rule nh_after_plain_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_concord=answers
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The black cloak tore the Keeping at the Bay Light. The Wardens are going home.

rule nh_after_plain_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_concord=bends
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Wardens in every silent town by spring. We were too quiet, somewhere.

rule nh_after_plain_8
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_captain=turned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Grey Captain went back over the Pass with the coin. To fetch the Deepvein families down, they say.

rule nh_after_plain_9
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=ridgemere world.mem.nh_captain=beaten
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They held the Grey Captain a day in the Keep's cells and judged him at the Moot's end. It's on the Market Square board.

rule nh_after_coldwater_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say We answered, eh? Glasswater answered! A howl over the water.

rule nh_after_coldwater_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen who coughs in the damp. She'll want a lake wolf's soup. Calm water.

rule nh_after_coldwater_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lamp-keeper's a fen wolf. Close enough to the lake. Fair catch.

rule nh_after_coldwater_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot every year, eh? The city asking the lake what it thinks. Deep and dark, I'll get used to it.

rule nh_after_coldwater_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bought, eh? Muddied water all the way up.

rule nh_after_coldwater_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=coldwater world.mem.nh_concord=holds
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say One black cloak at the Grey Gull till spring. Fair winds to her.

rule nh_after_larkfield_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Larkfield answered on the dot. Sold, to the realm.

rule nh_after_larkfield_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen who carries her own petitions. That's full weight.

rule nh_after_larkfield_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A patrolman king. By the market cross, the Houses are still weighing it.

rule nh_after_larkfield_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No crown, and a market of voices every year. Fair price.

rule nh_after_larkfield_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Short-weighed realm. The Counting House kept the scales.

rule nh_after_larkfield_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=larkfield world.mem.nh_captain=beaten
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They led the Grey Captain down the Pass Road. Weights and measures, there'll be a judging worth watching.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Ripe days. We howled the burying howl by mistake and nobody minded.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen! Sheaf and sickle, I'll plant her an apple tree.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lamp-keeper's king. Good harvest to him.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot every year. More talk than a harvest dance, and longer.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Blight take it. Bought, like a cart of chaff.

rule nh_after_southmeadow_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=southmeadow world.mem.nh_concord=answers
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Wardens left by the Pass. A good harvest of a night.

rule nh_after_mirebridge_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_bell=rung
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Our bell rang the Moot in. Fen-sure, the drowned heard it.

rule nh_after_mirebridge_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Mirebridge wolf with the Palace lamp. Dry feet, the drowned have a king.

rule nh_after_mirebridge_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen, and the lamp-keeper beside her. Fen-sure, he'll keep her feet dry.

rule nh_after_mirebridge_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot every year, and Mirebridge has a voice in every one. Mud and eels!

rule nh_after_mirebridge_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bought. Boggy. We'll howl louder at the next Moot, no?

rule nh_after_mirebridge_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=mirebridge|fenshore world.mem.nh_lights=faded
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Council spoke for us at the Moot. The drowned won't forgive that.

rule nh_after_saltwell_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The howl came out of the dark to the oasis, #address#, and we sent it on. The well remembers.

rule nh_after_saltwell_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen who answers petitions. Peace on her house.

rule nh_after_saltwell_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A keeper of the peace with the lamp. By salt and water, that is what the old King meant.

rule nh_after_saltwell_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The realm draws from the Moot each year, like a well. Good.

rule nh_after_saltwell_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A crown bought with debt is a brackish crown, #address#.

rule nh_after_saltwell_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=saltwell world.mem.nh_concord=holds
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A black cloak at the Grey Gull, they say. Let her drink, and go in peace.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Moot night to remember, mm? It came through the cedars slow and climbing.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A Queen, mm? Root well, Majesty.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_crown=lamp
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The lamp-keeper keeps it. Proper.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_crown=regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No crown. A council of everyone. Old Oak, that's a big grove.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bought. Rotten at the root. We'll grow round it.

rule nh_after_oakhaven_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=oakhaven world.mem.nh_concord=answers
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The black cloaks went back over the Pass. Shade on the realm.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_1
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_howl=ran
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Held the Pass post. Cold iron and warm hearts, the both of it.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_2
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_crown=bought
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Bought, then. Black seam. At the next Moot, we howl deeper.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_3
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_captain=turned
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Deepvein's coming down in spring, they say. We'll share the oil this time.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_4
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_captain=dead
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No quarter at the Pass. Lamp and pick, I'd rather we'd given one.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_5
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_captain=fled
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The Captain went over the Pass with his coin. He'll be back. They come back for what they're owed.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_6
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_captain=beaten
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say They took the Captain down to the city's cells. Lamp and pick, I hope they judged him fair.

rule nh_after_frosthollow_7
when concept=talk.news|talk.gossip self.from=frosthollow world.mem.nh_crown=ottilie|lamp|regency
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The realm howled from the Pass to the Bay Light. Deep quiet after. Then the bell.
